Sure, you'd think so...          Unfortunately, it doesn't.
The total amount of weight you can carry (ignoring, ie, not subtracting,
the weight of the ring and/or GoP) is THE SAME whether your strength is
18/**, 21 or 25.   That's the way the formula works, but I don't have
the code to prove it.    

>                                        (BTW he's got a bag of holding
>_crammed_ with stuff.  Will putting the BoH inside another BoH reduce the
>weight further?)  

Well, sort off. :-)  Your weight WILL be reduced, but only because both bags
and contents will explode, so you all you neato stuff goes bye-bye.  You
won't be able to carry more, you'll just have less to carry!

BTW, I think I saw in an earlier post that you can carry more by putting
everything into 1 BoH instead of using two.  Of course, there are reasons
to use two BoH, so my word is not gospel. 

I will stand by my above statements until someone disagrees with me. :-)

